meta {
  name: Communities - List
  type: http
  seq: 121
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities?limit=10&offset=0
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  limit: 10
  offset: 0
  ~visibility: public
  ~query: knowledge
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  The communities of the signed-in member (#828): the ones they own and the ones they belong to, by name. Offset pagination (limit, offset; metadata.pagination). Optional filters: visibility (personal, private or public) and query (name contains, case-insensitive). Get one community for its moderator rights and member count. Token ability: communities:read.
}
